# Day 10 — Personal Portfolio Website

## Overview

For Day 10 of the #60DayClaudeChallenge, I built a modern personal portfolio website showcasing my background, education, experience, skills, projects, and professional goals.

The portfolio was designed to strengthen my personal brand and create a professional online presence.

## Features

- Modern responsive design
- Professional hero section
- Personal branding
- Education & Experience timeline
- Project showcase
- Contact section
- Glassmorphism UI
- Mobile-friendly layout
- Tailwind CSS styling

## Tech Stack

- HTML5
- Tailwind CSS
- JavaScript

## Key Learning

A portfolio is more than a collection of projects. It tells your professional story and helps others understand who you are, what you do, and the value you can bring.

